url: "https://mcp-data-platform.txn2.com"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.119.0
date-released: "2026-08-04"
keywords:
  - Model Context Protocol
  - semantic layer
  - data catalog
  - knowledge layer
  - agent tooling
